				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aconiton,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					7, 407</span></i>
			.—In plur., <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 2,
				152</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 7, 419</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Aus. Idyll. 12, 9, 11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Luc. 4,
			322</span></i>. —For <i>a strong poison</i> in
			gen., <i><span class="en">Ov.
				M. 1, 147</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 10, 25</span></i>.</div>
